OL,3,GNEWSAChocolates from 90s left uneaten
OL,4,Ain memory of girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA selection box from the 1990s will
OL,7,Fremain uneaten in tribute to a young
OL,8,Fgirl who died before she could receive
OL,9,Fit as a Christmas gift 36 years ago.
OL,11,FSusan Peacock, from Middlesbrough, was
OL,12,Fseven when she died in a car accident
OL,13,Fand her dad Stephen kept the Cadbury's
OL,14,Fchocolates she never opened in memory
OL,15,Fof her.
OL,17,FHe has now passed the box on to Susan's
OL,18,Ftwin sister Rachel who said she will
OL,19,Fpreserve it "for as long as possible".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
