OL,3,GNEWSAChocolates from 90s left uneaten
OL,4,Ain memory of girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachel, 42, posted the vintage box of
OL,7,Fchocolates on social media and said she
OL,8,Fwas overwhelmed by the "unbelievable"
OL,9,Fresponse from people with memories of
OL,10,Floved ones who had bought them a
OL,11,Fsimilar gift for Christmas.
